{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24972","headline":"送羽衣之京 · 牟融","name":"送羽衣之京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽衣缥缈拂尘嚣，怅别河梁赠柳条。\n阆苑云深孤鹤逈，蓬莱天近一身遥。\n香浮宝辇仙风润，花落瑶坛绦雨消。\n自是长生林下客，也陪鸳鹭入清朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}